When a room is marked by the game as a 'temple' (i.e. it started out 
with a priest in attendance) then if the priest leaves (either to go the 
the great beyond or just down the street) the temple is marked as 
'desecrated' and you get ghosts and whatnot.  The names of ghosts are 
pulled from a fixed list plus your old char names from your record file.

